 <ThingDef ParentName="ResourceBase"><defName>EH_CourtHeraldSigil</defName><label>Herald crucible sigil</label><description>A broken-crown crucible key recovered from a fallen Court Herald or treasury. At a drug lab after Fabrication, dismantle it into four essences of any one ordinary element. It does not grant evolution or Celestial power.</description><stackLimit>25</stackLimit><tradeability>Sellable</tradeability><thingCategories><li>EH_ElementalMaterials</li></thingCategories><graphicData><texPath>UI/ElementalHearts/Court/HeraldSeal</texPath><graphicClass>Graphic_Single</graphicClass><drawSize>0.55</drawSize></graphicData><statBases><MarketValue>400</MarketValue><Mass>0.1</Mass><DeteriorationRate>0</DeteriorationRate><Flammability>0</Flammability></statBases></ThingDef>
