 <RecipeDef ParentName="EH_CrucibleRecipeBase"><defName>EH_CondenseFlameEssence</defName><label>condense Flame serum from essence</label><description>Condense eight flame essences with industrial medicine and a component into one Flame serum. Preserves existing serum recipes.</description><jobString>Condensing Flame essence.</jobString><workAmount>10000</workAmount><ingredients><li><filter><thingDefs><li>EH_EssenceFlame</li></thingDefs></filter><count>8</count></li><li><filter><thingDefs><li>MedicineIndustrial</li></thingDefs></filter><count>2</count></li><li><filter><thingDefs><li>ComponentIndustrial</li></thingDefs></filter><count>1</count></li></ingredients><fixedIngredientFilter><thingDefs><li>EH_EssenceFlame</li><li>MedicineIndustrial</li><li>ComponentIndustrial</li></thingDefs></fixedIngredientFilter><products><EH_FlameHeart>1</EH_FlameHeart></products></RecipeDef>
